@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
node "Demonstration computer" {
 node "Browser" as Browser
 node "Python 3.11+ process" as Python {
  artifact "prototype package" as App
  artifact "In-memory sessions" as Session
 }
 artifact "discivium.sqlite3\nrecords + BLOBs" as File
}
Browser --> Python : HTTP / loopback :8000
App --> File : sqlite3 file I/O
App --> Session : session resolution
note bottom of File
Fictional records only.
No cloud dependency or production deployment.
end note
@enduml
